test(rate-limit): ff-agent loop tests for window-aware backoff (#571)

- rate_limit_delay: Retry-After honored + clamped; exponential when absent;
  far-out attempt saturates (no shl overflow).
- retry_backoff_ms: routes RateLimited to its own budget/Retry-After and other
  transient errors to the transport schedule; fatal -> None.
- Loop (start_paused virtual time): RateLimited-then-success recovers; a
  Retry-After window is waited out and recovers; a persistent limit fails
  cleanly after exactly MAX_RATE_LIMIT_ATTEMPTS+1 calls, proving the rate-limit
  budget is separate from the transport budget.

Refs #571